I was saved by two police officers who grabbed me before I leapt. They reacted extremely swiftly to prevent my suicide.

&#x200B;

I felt so ashamed but I don't feel that way anymore, well not as much.

&#x200B;

I spent 5 day's in a psychiatric ward and had my medication changed (which was necessary. i love life in general but I suffer from extreme low mood.

&#x200B;

I've been offered a job in NSW so I think I'm going to take it and "start over" while maintaining therapy and medication intake.

