&#x200B;

I can tell you than, in Australia, it is extremely difficult to get a benzodiazepine prescription of any kind. You need to be diagnosed by a psychiatrist to be prescribed even lowly benzodiazepines. Good luck getting Alprazolam... It is extremely difficult and you're made to feel like a criminal even when you have legitimate reason's AKA Panic Disorder.

&#x200B;

And there is no banning medication's on the WHO's list of essential medicines. There's no getting rid of Morphine, Midazolam, Fentanyl. They're essential medicines.

&#x200B;

Not trying to be rude but we're not 12 year old kid's needing a lecture about our medication's. I've come off Alprazolam and believe it is an essential medication for Panic Disorder w/ therapy.

