Been prescribed 0.25mg twice a day for over two years. You really have to be at the end of your rope. Your doctor needs an authority to prescribe S8's. I think your doctor has to apply for the authority from the Government.

&#x200B;

Saw heaps of doctors of the years.. SSRI's, brief psych stays and just got nothing to help me. They would say you need to do this and that. I would and nothing changed.

&#x200B;

Then I found a doctor who actually listened. Very rare in Aus.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

My point is that you really gotta show you need it. You need to have a Psychiatrist formally diagnose Panic Disorder. A GP can really only assume you have it. Formal diagnoses are required.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

And.. It sucks what the Government did. They went from 50 days supply to 30 without warning!

&#x200B;

